  <baseType>
    core:Documentation
  </baseType>
  <is>
    What BlockDoc V1 includes and accepts
  </is>
  <documentation>
    V1 ships static HTML by package/FQN hierarchy with:
    
    • Registry name blockdoc; accepts library, corpus, auto
    • Options: siteMode (merged|perLibrary), outLayout (fqn|package), includeNonExported
    • Block pages, package indexes (fqn layout), All Blocks listing, site home (BD27)
    • Sticky toolbar with Index + All Blocks + keyword quick search; search-index.json at site root
    • Type links for known named FQNs; member tables; composition trees
    • Control gate: renders without requiring Stage-2 semantic success
    
    Not V1 (see ScopeExclusions): dependency graphs, authored XML example surfaces,
    package-layout collision tooling.
  </documentation>
  <references>
    <see type="bddocumentation:PublicApi" relation="ReadNext" />
  </references>
</bddocumentation:V1Scope>
